; Can.tscn, r 0.035 x h 0.12, 0.35 kg, tin voice. Same scheme as the boxes at 0.16 m centres.
; Cans and boxes are shelved on SEPARATE aisles on purpose and it is a gameplay fact, not
; merchandising: SFX-1 gave each material its own voice, so knocking a can over in the dark
; tells the other player which aisle you are in.

