; --- twenty-four pieces of produce, the end-caps and the bins ----------------------------------
; Produce.tscn, r 0.08, 0.25 kg, damped so it does not roll out of the room. Twelve on the two
; end-caps (two per shelf) and twelve loose in the six bins (two each, resting on the bin's
; interior floor at y = 0.06 + the sphere's own radius). Produce is the kind that is NOT on a
; long aisle, which is what makes "which population did the hider choose" a real choice: hiding
; a deal orange means hiding it among two dozen scattered oranges, not among four dozen cans in
; a row.

